# Four players on three paths of different quality each throw a box into a heap of 300.
scenario load_four
scene load300
seed 23
guests 3
settle 12s

net g1 rtt 50ms loss 1%
net g2 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2%
net g3 rtt 200ms jitter 40ms loss 5%

p0 walk load200
p0 grab load200 as a0
p0 wait 300ms
p0 throw 0 0.5 0 speed 9
p1 walk load290
p1 grab load290 as a1
p1 wait 300ms
p1 throw 0 0.5 0 speed 9
p2 walk load209
p2 grab load209 as a2
p2 wait 300ms
p2 throw 0 0.5 0 speed 9
p3 walk load299
p3 grab load299 as a3
p3 wait 300ms
p3 throw 0 0.5 0 speed 9

expect result a0 granted
expect result a1 granted
expect result a2 granted
expect result a3 granted
expect agree_at_rest 5cm
expect no_stuck
